library "Policy".
concept "Obese":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "BMI Library"."BMI" at least 30 'kg/m2'.
- shape reduction is most recent.
activity "Approve":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
- with `APPROVED`.
activity "Deny":
